              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 11:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebirikukwata aha kuteeranira abarikwera empiiha, nk'oku naaragiire amakanisa ag'omuri Galatia, naimwe mube nikwo mwagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro ky'okubanza omu saabiiti, buri muntu omuriimwe agume abiikye omu ka ye ebi arikubaasa aha bi atungire, ku ndiba naizire, harekye kubaho okuteerana empiiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ndihika okwo, abu muriha ebaruha z'okubasiima, nibo ndyohereza kutwara ebiconco byanyu Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi naanye ku kiriba kinshemereire kugyenda, turyagyendana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
